            <ArticleTitle>[Severe bronchial asthma in elderly patients].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>102-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Cytological and oxidative characteristics of bronchial inflammation before and after treatment were studied in 35 elderly patients with severe bronchial asthma (BA). Revealed cytooxidative particularities may be used as additional diagnostic and treatment efficacy markers in elderly patients with severe BA.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
